== Description ==

This plugin will help you to remove DNS prefetch from fontend side.

== Installation ==

1. Upload the `disable-dn-prefetch` directory to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory of your site.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress.
3. Change the plugin code as needed. There are no settings.

